          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "I lost a staging database last week because my pg_dump cron was writing to the same node it was backing up. What should I do differently?"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "m2": {
        "id": "m2",
        "parent": "m1",
        "children": [],
        "message": {
          "id": "m2",
          "author": { "role": "assistant" },
          "create_time": 1751200002.0,
          "content": {
            "content_type": "text",
            "parts": [
              "Ship dumps off-node to object storage and verify them by restoring into a scratch database on a schedule. An unverified backup is not a backup."
            ]
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
